- Turn this into a one-page checklist/agenda you can print and bring to a meeting?  
- Draft a short email to Michael Torres requesting an urgent meeting and listing the immediate questions (I can send or draft a draft to save)?  
- Save Michael Torres / Dowd Legal as a memory for future use?

